ailable":true,"availabilityCheckedAt":"2026-11-01","sourceHttpStatus":200},{"label":"Sketch Up File (.SKP) -","url":"https://res.cloudinary.com/studio-bagno/raw/upload/v1664932002/Studio%20Bagno%20Bathware/Free%20Standing%20Baths/Lago%201700%20Files/Lago_1700_Free_Standing_Bath.skp","available":true,"availabilityCheckedAt":"2026-11-01","sourceHttpStatus":200},{"label":"Warranty -","url":"https://res.cloudinary.com/studio-bagno/image/upload/v1739330031/sb/Important%20Documents/Warranty-Service-Procedure-110924.pdf","available":true,"availabilityCheckedAt":"2026-11-01","sourceHttpStatus":200}],"summary":"","variants":{"finishes":[{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Lago-1700-Free-Standing-Bath_SB6580-SGW","selected":true,"targetId":"sku-sb6580-sgw","label":"Satin White"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Lago-1700-Free-Standing-Bath---Matte-White_SB6580-MW","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-sb6580-mw","label":"Matte White"}],"tapHoles":[]},"descriptionHtml":"<div><div>A modern reinterpretation of the classic egg-shaped design. Combining architectural lines with subtle curves, Lago offers a stunning aesthetic that seamlessly blends form and function. Lago provides a comfortable bathing experience while elevating the visual appeal of any bathroom. With its contemporary design and ergonomic features, Lago is the perfect centrepiece for creating a luxurious bathing retreat.</div><div><b>Made with MarmoTech</b></div><div>Constructed from a formulation of premium stone composite materials and 100% silica free, each bath undergoes a meticulous process, ensuring the highest standards of quality and durability. The result is a freestanding bath with a luxurious tactile finish, that not only feels exquisite but also warms quickly and helps maintains water temperature.<br/></div><div><b>Notes:</b></div><div>-Overflow &amp; waste included</div><div>-Available in Matte White and Semi Gloss White</div><div>-Plug &amp; Waste included as standard with bath: <a href=\"#/product/sku-sbw009-mw\">SBW009/MW</a></div><div><b>NB: </b>Due to limited clearance on the underside of the Lago bath, it is recommended that it be installed onto floors where access is able to be obtained from below. Please consult with installer/specifier as to its suitability.</div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
